  "answer": "1‑Ustaxona (rezistorlar ketma‑ket ulangan – seri):  \n\nRezistor\tQ value (Ω)\tTok (I) (A)\tKuchlanish (V)\tQuvvat (W)\nR₁\t6 Ω\t2 A\tV₁ = I·R₁ = 12 V\tP₁ = I²·R₁ = 24 W\nR₂\t3 Ω\t2 A\tV₂ = I·R₂ = 6 V\tP₂ = I²·R₂ = 12 W\n\nUmumiy qarshilik  \n\n𝑅\ntotal\n=\n𝑅\n1\n+\n𝑅\n2\n=\n6\n \nΩ\n+\n3\n \nΩ\n=\n9\n \nΩ\nR\ntotal\n\t​\n\n=R\n1\n\t​\n\n+R\n2\n\t​\n\n=6 Ω+3 Ω=9 Ω\n\nTok kuchi  \n\n𝐼\n=\n𝑈\nmanba\n𝑅\ntotal\n=\n18\n V\n9\n \nΩ\n=\n2\n A\nI=\nR\ntotal\n\t​\n\nU\nmanba\n\t​\n\n\t​\n\n=\n9 Ω\n18 V\n\t​\n\n=2 A\n\nKuchlanishlar  \n\n𝑈\n1\n=\n𝐼\n⋅\n𝑅\n1\n=\n2\n⋅\n6\n=\n12\n V\n,\n𝑈\n2\n=\n𝐼\n⋅\n𝑅\n2\n=\n2\n⋅\n3\n=\n6\n V\nU\n1\n\t​\n\n=I⋅R\n1\n\t​\n\n=2⋅6=12 V,U\n2\n\t​\n\n=I⋅R\n2\n\t​\n\n=2⋅3=6 V\n\nQuvvatlar  \n\n𝑃\n1\n=\n𝐼\n2\n⋅\n𝑅\n1\n=\n4\n⋅\n6\n=\n24\n W\n,\n𝑃\n2\n=\n𝐼\n2\n⋅\n𝑅\n2\n=\n4\n⋅\n3\n=\n12\n W\nP\n1\n\t​\n\n=I\n2\n⋅R\n1\n\t​\n\n=4⋅6=24 W,P\n2\n\t​\n\n=I\n2\n⋅R\n2\n\t​\n\n=4⋅3=12 W\n\nQuvvatlarning yig‘indisi  \n\n𝑃\njami\n=\n𝑃\n1\n+\n𝑃\n2\n=\n24\n W\n+\n12\n W\n=\n36\n W\nP\njami\n\t​\n\n=P\n1\n\t​\n\n+P\n2\n\t​\n\n=24 W+12 W=36 W\n\nManba quvvati  \n\n𝑃\nmanba\n=\n𝑈\nmanba\n⋅\n𝐼\n=\n18\n V\n⋅\n2\n A\n=\n36\n W\nP\nmanba\n\t​\n\n=U\nmanba\n\t​\n\n⋅I=18 V⋅2 A=36 W\n\nShu bilan quvvatlar yig‘indisi manba quvvati bilan to‘liq mos keladi.\n\n---\n\n2‑Parallel ulanish (rezistorlar parallel):  \n\nEkvivalent qarshilik  \n\n1\n𝑅\np\n=\n1\n6\n+\n1\n3\n=\n1\n6\n+\n2\n6\n=\n3\n6\n=\n0.5\nR\np\n\t​\n\n1\n\t​\n\n=\n6\n1\n\t​\n\n+\n3\n1\n\t​\n\n=\n6\n1\n\t​\n\n+\n6\n2\n\t​\n\n=\n6\n3\n\t​\n\n=0.5\n𝑅\np\n=\n1\n0.5\n=\n2\n \nΩ\nR\np\n\t​\n\n=\n0.5\n1\n\t​\n\n=2 Ω\n\nManba tokini hisoblash  \n\n𝐼\np\n=\n𝑈\nmanba\n𝑅\np\n=\n18\n V\n2\n \nΩ\n=\n9\n A\nI\np\n\t​\n\n=\nR\np\n\t​\n\nU\nmanba\n\t​\n\n\t​\n\n=\n2 Ω\n18 V\n\t​\n\n=9 A\n\nBu yerda tok 2 A‑dan 9 A‑ga oshadi, chunki ekvivalent qarshilik 9 Ω‑dan 2 Ω‑ga kamaydi, lekin manba kuchlanishi o‘zgarmadi (18 V).\n\nHar bir rezistor orqali oqayotgan tok  \n\n𝐼\n1\n=\n𝑈\n𝑅\n1\n=\n18\n6\n=\n3\n A\n,\n𝐼\n2\n=\n𝑈\n𝑅\n2\n=\n18\n3\n=\n6\n A\nI\n1\n\t​\n\n=\nR\n1\n\t​\n\nU\n\t​\n\n=\n6\n18\n\t​\n\n=3 A,I\n2\n\t​\n\n=\nR\n2\n\t​\n\nU\n\t​\n\n=\n3\n18\n\t​\n\n=6 A\n\nQuvvatlar  \n\n𝑃\n1\n=\n𝑈\n⋅\n𝐼\n1\n=\n18\n⋅\n3\n=\n54\n W\n,\n𝑃\n2\n=\n𝑈\n⋅\n𝐼\n2\n=\n18\n⋅\n6\n=\n108\n W\nP\n1\n\t​\n\n=U⋅I\n1\n\t​\n\n=18⋅3=54 W,P\n2\n\t​\n\n=U⋅I\n2\n\t​\n\n=18⋅6=108 W\n𝑃\njami\n=\n54\n W\n+\n108\n W\n=\n162\n W\n=\n𝑈\n⋅\n𝐼\np\nP\njami\n\t​\n\n=54 W+108 W=162 W=U⋅I\np\n\t​\n\n\nDemak, rezistorlar parallel ulanganida umumiy tok sezilarli darajada ko‘payadi (2 A → 9 A), lekin har bir rezistor ustidagi kuchlanish 18 V sifatida bir xil qoladi. Tok, kuchlanish va energiya (quvvat) bir-biridan farqli tushunchalar ekanligini yodda tutish zarur: tok – elektr zaryadining vaqt birligidagi oqimi, kuchlanish – bir zaryad birlikka ish, quvvat esa bir vaqt birligidagi energiya sarflanishi.\n\n---\n\nQo‘shnini shanbada ta’mirlash ustaxonasiga taklif qiluvchi uchta jumla (tabiiy, samimiy):  \n\n“Qo‘shni, shanba kuni men bilan ustaxonaga kel, birgalikda eski lampalarni almashtiraylik, keyin bir choy ichib suhbatlashamiz.”\n“Shanba kunida birga ishlashni istasangiz, men sizni ustaxona bilan tanishtiraman – bir oz elektr ta’mirlash, bir oz hazil‑hazil.”\n“Agar shanba kuni vaqtingiz bo‘lsa, kelib qo‘shni, birga rezistorlarni o‘rganamiz, keyin esa qahvaxona tomon yurib dam olamiz.”",
